    "sub_name": "社會團結企業理念與社會創新思維",
    "sub_ename": "SOCIAL & SOLIDARITY ENTERPRISE IDEOLOGIES & SOCIAL INNOVATION ZEITGEIST",
    "describe_ch": "社會團結經濟統整跨學科整合訓練，對既有多元社會企業和合作社及非營利與部門經濟和治理，結合心理、社會、經濟與法律基礎，探索成功典範MONDRAGON集團和量販店及替補貨幣等，拓充現代商業經營就業力！",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to broaden the scope of the knowledge economy through contemporary social and solidarity economy ideologies and social innovation zeitgeist. Based on key success factors from CWS, ESOP, MONDRAGON’s progressive innovations accordingly. The conceptualized framework for improving outcome-oriented teaching will be used to increase and broaden the capacities as employability.",
